This collection of files contains color images for my dissertation,
"Ray Tracing with Amalgams," which is available elsewhere via
anonymous FTP.  Each file's name corresponds to its image number in the
dissertation.  For example, file 'img1ab.rle' contains Images 1a and 1b
from the dissertation.

The files were compressed before packing into the archive file.  To 
uncompress, give the (Unix) command "uncompress *.Z".

The uncompressed files are in Utah RLE format.  If your site doesn't
have the Utah Raster Toolkit, you can get it via anonymous FTP from the
following sources:

        cs.utah.edu (128.110.4.21)
        weedeater.math.yale.edu (130.132.23.17)
        freebie.engin.umich.edu (35.2.68.23)

(Site 'weedeater' probably also has the text of the dissertation in
Postscript.)

